# NetBird Project Licensing Overview

This deployment repository (`KIF-Office-Workstation/netbird-setup`) provides configuration templates, automation scripts, and documentation for deploying NetBird infrastructure.

---

## Upstream Component Licenses

NetBird software components are distributed under a dual open-source licensing model:

1. **Client & General Core Components (BSD 3-Clause License)**
   - The NetBird client agent (`netbird`), CLI, desktop UI, and core library components are licensed under the **BSD 3-Clause License**.

2. **Server Components & Combined Container (GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 - AGPLv3)**
   - The NetBird server components including `management/`, `signal/`, `relay/`, and the combined server (`netbirdio/netbird-server`) are licensed under **AGPLv3**.

---

## Open Source & Self-Hosted Use

- Self-hosted deployment and operational use of the combined NetBird server architecture remain **100% free and open-source** under the AGPLv3 license.
- Infrastructure automation scripts and configuration templates in this repository are provided under the BSD 3-Clause License.

